e did you know everything was built on lies. \n\nThe question is are you ready to face the music in order to uncover the truth? FIGHT, HACK and EXPLORE your way to uncover the truth behind the facades of the city of North Haven.\n\nLIMITED EARLY ACCESS 0.5 - Summer 2022: Includes a very limited part of the final game: Part of Alleyway level & Arcade Mode. We want to welcome you aboard as early as possible so you already can get the immersive feel of the game and have the chance to shape the future of the game.\n\nFULL EARLY ACCESS 1.0 - Fall 2022: Full early access will be released by the end of the year.\n\nFULL EP. 1: 2023", "short_description": "Deceptive Reality is a story-driven action-adventure game set in the Dystopian City of North Haven. \n\nThe question is are you ready to face the music in order to uncover the truth? FIGHT, HACK and EXPLORE your way to uncover the truth behind the facades of the city of North Haven.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.deceptive-reality.com/privacy-policy-deceptive-reality", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Quarantine Studios VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deceptive-reality.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "457653445836593"}}]}, "scheduled_